{"product_id":"horrid-henrys-monster-movie","title":"Horrid Henry's Monster Movie","description":"\u003cp\u003eFour brand new stories in which Horrid Henry makes his own scary movie, The Undead Demon Monster Who Would Not Die, persuades Peter to hand over his stash of Grump Cards (as a brilliant scheme to get him out of the punishments his parents give him) and spends a weekend at Aunt Ruby's where he has to share a bedroom with his two arch-enemies, Stuck-Up Steve and Bossy Bill. Then when Henry's school decides to have a mini-Olympics, he sets up his own Holympics, with medals for crisp-eating, TV watching, and Burping to the Beat. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:127 x 196  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Francesca Simon \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781444000153 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44809016901785,"sku":"16RB-1-9781444000153","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/630eb2406cf3767df08e5511bb5c3e40.jpg?v=1725865990","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/horrid-henrys-monster-movie","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}